{
  "_doc": "Tier-2 roadside gas station on Route 9 across from the Mile 9 Diner (region D6, feature cordon_gas). Front (+Z) faces the highway. Route: forecourt under the canopy -> shop doors boarded from outside (SICK INSIDE) -> round to bay 1, its roll-up door left up -> garage: the mechanic under the pickup on the lift, Jess's note and the stockroom key on the workbench (taking it wakes the mechanic) -> down the inspection pit in bay 2 (level -1) -> through the knocked-out pit wall (can chime: it wakes Dale) and Dale's bear trap in the crawl into his furnace cellar: Dale, his ledger, the safe key in his coat -> ladder up through the hatch into the back office -> behind the counter into the shop: the sick locked in (ambush on the loose boards behind the counter, the till or the stockroom door) -> stockroom door, unlocked with the stockroom key (gate) -> stockroom loot: Dale's safe (his key), tool chest, oil shelf; Kell's girl guards it -> unbolt the side door onto the forecourt (Dale wired it to an alarm: pull the wire first). The restroom is padlocked from outside with the Guard boy inside. The pit and the cellar are level -1 rooms: they need the terrain holes POI cellars get (TD-026). See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
